  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 41 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E13", "E12", "D1"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The label for NDC 55150-0119-09 lists Aurobindo Pharma Limited (FEI 3004446312) as a registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1286862 of that plant ended on 2025-09-05 and was classified OAI, with the classification known on 2025-12-04.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 41 days before the Fresenius Kabi discontinuation posting on 2026-01-20.",
      "cites": ["E12", "E18", "D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same label also names Eugia SEZ Private Limited (FEI 3011905047) as a registered plant for analysis, manufacture, and pack, last inspected VAI on 2019-03-01.",
      "cites": ["E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A second label (NDC 83634-0112-99) names ACS DOBFAR SPA as a sponsor-only manufacturing site.",
      "cites": ["E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC appears on the FDA shortage list with status To Be Discontinued, initial posting 2026-01-20, citing discontinuation of manufacture.",
      "cites": ["E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory across Corvale sites provides 18 to 24 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    }
  ]
}
